Before moving on, verify that you can show another engineer: (1) the intent decision; (2) the unchanged threshold; (3) the original red result; (4) the candidate diff; (5) the independently run green result; and (6) a written verdict stating the remaining limitations. If any of these is missing, the missing part is your next engineering task.
